diff --git a/docs/api/sections/reactions.md b/docs/api/sections/reactions.md
index 0caa20f..688e243 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/reactions.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/reactions.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # Reactions
 
-Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to comments.
+Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to comments and cards. Only the person who added a reaction can remove it.
 
 ## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/comments/:comment_id/reactions`
 
@@ -56,3 +56,62 @@ Removes your reaction from a comment.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Card reactions
+
+Reactions can also be added directly to a card. A card's reaction count is shown as its boost count on board previews.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Returns a list of reactions on a card.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+    "content": "🎉",
+    "reacter": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/reactions/03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz"
+  }
+]
+```
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Adds a reaction to a card. Returns `403 Forbidden` if the card is not published.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `content` | string | Yes | The reaction text |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "reaction": {
+    "content": "🎉"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions/:reaction_id`
+
+Removes your reaction from a card.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
